                          "answer": "Some of the popular dishes at Pizza Hut include Tandoori Paneer Ultimate Cheese Pizza, Mazedar Makhni Paneer, Masala Lemonade, and Create Your Flavour Fun Combo - Box Of 4 - Veg."
